    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eae82352182dc476b145d0b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当天中山赛场挤满了观众，\n跟一年前完全不能比……\n不，跟过去的任何比赛都无法相比。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbaf69a7184822b300ca9539f98ceb1741ab5e86da32bcfa7f1764c4578bbd80",
